	(descr "RichWave RTC6705 5.8 GHz FM transmitter, QFN-40 6x6 mm P0.5, EP 4.42 = GND (41). Land copied from the OpenVTX library (QFN-40_L6.0-W6.0-P0.50-BL-EP = EasyEDA C913074: 0.28 x 0.66 at 2.91), re-oriented to pin 1 top-left; RTC6705 DS V0.2 has no land pattern (pins p3-4, package p11-12). EP paste 3x3 x 1.20 mm (66 %); EP vias placed on the board (P5). | IPC-7351 least density (L) variant per D109: all 40 lands (D101), toe 3.08 (D 6 BSC, +-0.05 assumed -> 3.05 + 0.03), heel 2.58 kept, width 0.25 = b nom, EP 4.42/paste unchanged")
